              </div>

              <div class="grid-3" style="font-size:0.85rem;">
                <div style="background:#f8fafc; padding:0.6rem; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                  <span style="font-size:0.7rem; color:#64748b; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; display:block;">Qon Guruhi:</span>
                  <strong style="color:#1e40af;">A(II) Rh+ (Musbat)</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#fff1f2; padding:0.6rem; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #fecdd3;">
                  <span style="font-size:0.7rem; color:#be123c; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; display:block;">Allergik Reaksiya:</span>
                  <strong style="color:#9f1239;">Penitsillin guruhiga BOR</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#f0fdf4; padding:0.6rem; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;">
                  <span style="font-size:0.7rem; color:#15803d; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:700; display:block;">Laboratoriya Holati:</span>
                  <strong style="color:#166534;">Qon tahlili: Tayyor</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#166534; font-weight:600;">
              Hamshira barcha ma'lumotlarni darhol ko'radi va bemorga noto'g'ri dori yuborilishining oldi to'liq olinadi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div id="compare-paper-box" style="display:none; background-color:#fff1f2; border:2px solid #fca5a5; border-radius:14px; padding:1.25rem;">
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem;">
              <strong style="color:#9f1239; font-size:0.95rem;">
                ❌ Eski An'anaviy Qog'oz Daftarlar Usuli
              </strong>
              <span style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; background:#ffffff; color:#be123c; padding:0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #fecdd3;">
                Qidiruv vaqti: 25-30 daqiqa
              </span>
            </div>

            <div style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #fecdd3; border-radius:10px; padding:1rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; font-size:0.875rem; color:#881337; line-height:1.6;">
              • Qalin kartoteka javonlaridan bemorning qog'oz kasallik tarixini qidirish talab etiladi.<br>
              • Shifokorning qo'lyozmasini tushunish qiyin, allergik ma'lumotlar boshqa varaqda qolib ketishi mumkin.<br>
              • Laboratoriyaga tahlil qog'ozini olib kelish uchun shaxsan borib-kelishga to'g'ri keladi.
            </div>

            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#9f1239; font-weight:700;">
              Qimmatli vaqt behuda qog'oz qidirishga sarflanadi va shoshilinch yordam ko'rsatish kechikishi mumkin.
            </p>
