      <!-- TAB 2: AMALIYOT VA QURILMALAR (PRACTICE, MOUSE, KEYBOARD & SIMULATOR)     -->
      <!-- ========================================================================= -->
      <div id="pane-practice" class="tab-pane">
        
        <!-- 1. Computer Hardware Structure -->
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="card-title">
            <span>🖥️</span> 1. Tibbiy kompyuterning tuzilishi (Grafik sxema)
          </h2>
          <p class="card-subtitle">
            Hamshira ish stantsiyasidagi shaxsiy kompyuter quyidagi 4 ta asosiy qismdan tashkil topgan:
          </p>

          <div class="grid-4">
            <div class="hw-card">
              <div class="hw-icon">🖥️</div>
              <h4>1. Monitor (Ekran)</h4>
              <p>Axborotni chiqarish: Bemor anketasi, tahlillar va kardiogrammani ko'rsatadi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hw-card">
              <div class="hw-icon">🖲️</div>
              <h4>2. Tizim bloki</h4>
              <p>Kompyuterning miyasi: Barcha hisob-kitoblar va ma'lumotlarni saqlaydi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hw-card">
              <div class="hw-icon">⌨️</div>
              <h4>3. Klaviatura</h4>
              <p>Axborot kiritish: Bemor ismi, dori dozasi va raqamlarni terish.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hw-card">
              <div class="hw-icon">🖱️</div>
              <h4>4. Sichqoncha</h4>
              <p>Boshqaruv: Ekrandagi kursorni harakatlantirish va buyruqlarni tanlash.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Power On & Safe Shutdown Algorithm -->
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="card-title">
            <span>⚡</span> 2. Kompyuterni to'g'ri yoqish va xavfsiz o'chirish algoritmi
          </h2>

          <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <!-- Power On -->
            <div style="background:#eff6ff; border:2px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:14px; padding:1.25rem;">
              <h4 style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:800; color:#1e3a8a; margin-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;">
                <span>🔌</span> Kompyuterni to'g'ri yoqish tartibi:
              </h4>
              <ul class="step-list">
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge">1</span>
                  <span><strong>Elektr toki:</strong> Rozetka va uzatgich (stabilizator) yoqilganligini tekshiring.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge">2</span>
                  <span><strong>Tizim bloki:</strong> Old panelidagi yirik <strong>Power</strong> tugmasini 1 marta bosing.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge">3</span>
                  <span><strong>Monitor:</strong> Agar monitor avtomatik yoqilmasa, quvvat tugmasini bosing.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge">4</span>
                  <span><strong>Tizimga kirish:</strong> Windows yuklangach, o'z hamshiralik login/parolingizni kiriting.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Shutdown -->
            <div style="background:#fff1f2; border:2px solid #fecdd3; border-radius:14px; padding:1.25rem;">
              <h4 style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:800; color:#9f1239; margin-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;">
                <span>🛑</span> Xavfsiz o'chirish (Qat'iy qoida):
              </h4>
              <ul class="step-list">
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge" style="background:#fecdd3; color:#9f1239;">1</span>
                  <span><strong>Ma'lumotlarni saqlash:</strong> Bemorlar kartochkasi va muolajalarini saqlang.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge" style="background:#fecdd3; color:#9f1239;">2</span>
                  <span><strong>Dasturlarni yopish:</strong> Ochiq tibbiy dasturlardan to'g'ri chiqing.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge" style="background:#fecdd3; color:#9f1239;">3</span>
                  <span><strong>Boshlash menyusi:</strong> Ekranning pastki burchagidagi <strong>"Boshlash" (Пуск/Start)</strong> tugmasini bosing.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <span class="step-badge" style="background:#fecdd3; color:#9f1239;">4</span>
                  <span><strong>O'chirish:</strong> <strong>"Tizimni o'chirish" (Завершение работы)</strong> buyrug'ini tanlang.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:#fffbeb; border:1px solid #fde68a; border-radius:10px; padding:0.85rem 1rem; font-size:0.85rem; color:#92400e; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;">
            <span>🔒</span>
            <span><strong>Palataga chiqishda ekranni tezkor qulflash:</strong> Begonalar ko'rmasligi uchun klaviaturadagi <kbd style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #fcd34d; padding:0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius:4px; font-weight:800;">Win + L</kbd> tugmalarini birga bosing.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Mouse Interactive Section -->
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="card-title">
            <span>🖱️</span> 3. Sichqoncha (Manipulyator) tuzilishi va amaliy vazifalari
          </h2>
          <p class="card-subtitle">
            Sichqonchaning qismlari ustiga bosing va ularning kasalxona tizimidagi aniq vazifasini bilib oling:
          </p>

          <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
            <!-- SVG Interactive Mouse -->
            <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:16px; padding:1.5rem; text-align:center;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 200 280" style="width:160px; height:auto; margin:0 auto; display:block; user-select:none;">
                <!-- Mouse Body -->
                <path id="svg-mouse-body" d="M 40,80 C 40,25 160,25 160,80 L 160,190 C 160,250 40,250 40,190 Z" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="4" onclick="selectMousePart('body')" style="cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;" />
                
                <!-- Left Button -->
                <path id="svg-mouse-left" d="M 42,80 C 42,35 95,35 95,35 L 95,110 L 42,110 Z" fill="#2563eb" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="2.5" onclick="selectMousePart('left')" style="cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;" />
                
                <!-- Right Button -->
                <path id="svg-mouse-right" d="M 105,35 C 105,35 158,35 158,80 L 158,110 L 105,110 Z" fill="#cbd5e1" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="2.5" onclick="selectMousePart('right')" style="cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;" />
                
                <!-- Scroll Wheel -->
                <rect id="svg-mouse-wheel" x="92" y="55" width="16" height="35" rx="8" fill="#64748b" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="2" onclick="selectMousePart('wheel')" style="cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;" />

                <text x="52" y="75" fill="#ffffff" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">Chap</text>
                <text x="115" y="75" fill="#1e293b" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">O'ng</text>
                <text x="75" y="200" fill="#64748b" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">Korpus</text>
              </svg>

              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:0.5rem; margin-top:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <button id="btn-mouse-left" class="btn-primary" style="padding:0.4rem 0.85rem; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="selectMousePart('left')">Chap tugma</button>
                <button id="btn-mouse-right" class="btn-secondary" style="padding:0.4rem 0.85rem; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="selectMousePart('right')">O'ng tugma</button>
                <button id="btn-mouse-wheel" class="btn-secondary" style="padding:0.4rem 0.85rem; font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="selectMousePart('wheel')">G'ildirakcha</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Mouse Explanation Box -->
            <div id="mouse-detail-box" style="background:#eff6ff; border:2px solid #93c5fd; border-radius:16px; padding:1.5rem;">
              <h4 id="mouse-detail-title" style="font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:900; color:#1e3a8a; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                Sichqonchaning Chap Tugmasi (Asosiy ishchi tugma)
              </h4>
              <div id="mouse-detail-desc" style="font-size:0.9rem; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.6;">
                <strong>1 marta bosish (Tanlash):</strong> Bemorlar ro'yxatidan kerakli bemorni tanlash, qon guruhi katakchasini belgilash yoki buyruq tugmasini bosish.<br><br>
                <strong>2 marta tez bosish (Ochish):</strong> Bemorning to'liq elektron kasallik tarixi faylini yoki tahlil natijalari varaqasini ochish.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Keyboard 5 Zones Interactive Section -->
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="card-title">
            <span>⌨️</span> 4. Klaviatura tuzilishi: 5 ta asosiy hudud
          </h2>
          <p class="card-subtitle">
            Klaviaturaning asosiy hududlarini tanlang va ularning tibbiyotdagi vazifalarini ko'ring:
          </p>

          <div style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <button id="btn-kb-numpad" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 0.9rem;" onclick="selectKbZone('numpad')">1. Raqamli blok (Numpad)</button>
            <button id="btn-kb-alpha" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 0.9rem;" onclick="selectKbZone('alpha')">2. Alifbo-matnli blok</button>
            <button id="btn-kb-special" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 0.9rem;" onclick="selectKbZone('special')">3. Boshqaruv (Tab, Enter, Ctrl)</button>
            <button id="btn-kb-function" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 0.9rem;" onclick="selectKbZone('function')">4. Funksional (F1-F12)</button>
            <button id="btn-kb-arrows" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem 0.9rem;" onclick="selectKbZone('arrows')">5. Strelkalar (Navigatsiya)</button>
          </div>

          <div id="kb-zone-detail" style="background:#f8fafc; border:2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:14px; padding:1.25rem;">
            <h4 id="kb-zone-title" style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:900; color:#0f766e; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
              1. Raqamli blok (Numpad) — Hamshiraning eng asosiy quroli
            </h4>
            <p id="kb-zone-desc" style="font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155; line-height:1.6;">
              Klaviaturaning o'ng tomonidagi kalkulyatorga o'xshash blok. Bemorning qon bosimi (120/80), pulsi (74), harorati (36.6) va dori dozasini bir qo'l bilan 3 barobar tez kiritish imkonini beradi. Yoqish uchun <strong>[Num Lock]</strong> tugmasi bosiladi.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Keyboard 3 Indicator Lights (LED Panel) -->
        <div class="card" style="border:2px solid #0d9488;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem;">
            <div>
              <span style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:900; background:#ccfbf1; color:#0f766e; padding:0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius:6px; text-transform:uppercase;">
                Asosiy Amaliy Mavzu
              </span>
              <h2 class="card-title" style="margin-top:0.35rem;">
                💡 Klaviaturadagi 3 ta Indikator Chirog'i (NUM, CAPS, SCROLL)
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="card-subtitle">
            Ularning vazifasi, qanday yoqish/o'chirish va tibbiyotda kiritish jarayonidagi roli
          </p>

          <!-- REALISTIC LED INDICATOR PANEL -->
          <div class="led-panel-box">
            <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.25rem;">
              <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;">
                <div style="font-size:0.75rem; font-family:monospace; color:#94a3b8; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
                  KLAVIATURA INDIKATORLAR PANELI (LED)
                </div>

                <!-- 3 Lamps Bezel -->
                <div class="led-bezel">
                  <!-- NUM -->
                  <div id="led-unit-num" class="led-unit active" onclick="toggleNumLock()">
                    <div id="lamp-num" class="led-lamp active"></div>
                    <span class="led-name">NUM</span>
                    <span id="tag-num" class="led-tag">YONIQ</span>
                  </div>

                  <div style="width:1px; height:40px; background:#334155;"></div>

                  <!-- CAPS -->
                  <div id="led-unit-caps" class="led-unit" onclick="toggleCapsLock()">
                    <div id="lamp-caps" class="led-lamp"></div>
                    <span class="led-name">CAPS</span>
                    <span id="tag-caps" class="led-tag">O'CHIQ</span>
                  </div>

                  <div style="width:1px; height:40px; background:#334155;"></div>

                  <!-- SCROLL -->
                  <div id="led-unit-scroll" class="led-unit" onclick="toggleScrollLock()">
                    <div id="lamp-scroll" class="led-lamp"></div>
                    <span class="led-name">SCROLL</span>
                    <span id="tag-scroll" class="led-tag">O'CHIQ</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Switch Buttons -->
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:0.8rem; color:#cbd5e1; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.5rem; text-align:center;">
                  Tugmalarni bosib tekshirib ko'ring:
                </div>
                <div class="switch-btn-group">
                  <button id="btn-toggle-num" class="switch-btn active" onclick="toggleNumLock()">
                    <span>[Num Lock]</span>
                    <small>O'chirish / Yoqish</small>
                  </button>
                  <button id="btn-toggle-caps" class="switch-btn" onclick="toggleCapsLock()">
                    <span>[Caps Lock]</span>
                    <small>O'chirish / Yoqish</small>
                  </button>
                  <button id="btn-toggle-scroll" class="switch-btn" onclick="toggleScrollLock()">
                    <span>[Scroll Lock]</span>
                    <small>O'chirish / Yoqish</small>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3 Detailed Explanation Cards -->
          <div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <!-- NUM LOCK -->
            <div class="pillar-card" style="border:1.5px solid #60a5fa; background:#f0f9ff;">
              <div>
                <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  <span style="font-weight:900; background:#dbeafe; color:#1e40af; padding:0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius:6px; font-family:monospace;">NUM</span>
                  <span id="card-status-num" style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#059669;">● Hozir Yoniq</span>
                </div>
                <h4 style="font-size:1.05rem;">1. NUM (Num Lock) — Raqamlar Qulfi</h4>
                <p style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#1e40af; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  Yoqish: [Num Lock] tugmasi
                </p>
                <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#334155; line-height:1.5;">
                  <strong>🟢 Yoniq bo'lsa:</strong> Klaviaturaning o'ng tomonidagi kalkulyator bloki (0-9) faol bo'ladi. Bosim (120/80), puls (74), harorat (36.6) kabi vital ko'rsatkichlarni bir qo'l bilan 3 barobar tez kiritasiz.<br><br>
                  <strong>🔴 O'chiq bo'lsa:</strong> Raqamlar yozilmaydi, strelka navigatsiyasiga aylanadi.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CAPS LOCK -->
            <div class="pillar-card" style="border:1.5px solid #818cf8; background:#eef2ff;">
              <div>
                <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  <span style="font-weight:900; background:#e0e7ff; color:#3730a3; padding:0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius:6px; font-family:monospace;">CAPS</span>
                  <span id="card-status-caps" style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#64748b;">○ Hozir O'chiq</span>
                </div>
                <h4 style="font-size:1.05rem;">2. CAPS (Caps Lock) — Katta Harflar</h4>
                <p style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#3730a3; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  Yoqish: [Caps Lock] tugmasi
                </p>
                <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#334155; line-height:1.5;">
                  <strong>🟢 Yoniq bo'lsa:</strong> Yozilayotgan barcha harflar doimiy KATTA harf bilan yoziladi. Masalan: <b>ALIYEV VALI, EKG, MRT, COVID-19</b>.<br><br>
                  <strong>⚪ O'chiq bo'lsa:</strong> Kichik harflar bilan yozadi. Faqat birinchi harfni katta qilish uchun <code>Shift</code> bosiladi.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- SCROLL LOCK -->
            <div class="pillar-card" style="border:1.5px solid #c084fc; background:#faf5ff;">
              <div>
                <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  <span style="font-weight:900; background:#f3e8ff; color:#6b21a8; padding:0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius:6px; font-family:monospace;">SCROLL</span>
                  <span id="card-status-scroll" style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#64748b;">○ Hozir O'chiq</span>
                </div>
                <h4 style="font-size:1.05rem;">3. SCROLL (Scroll Lock) — Varaqlash</h4>
                <p style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; color:#6b21a8; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                  Yoqish: [Scroll Lock] tugmasi
                </p>
                <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#334155; line-height:1.5;">
                  <strong>🟢 Yoniq bo'lsa:</strong> Excel va tibbiy elektron jadvallarda kursor katakda turgan holda butun sahifani strelkalar bilan varaqlash imkonini beradi.<br><br>
                  <strong>⚪ O'chiq bo'lsa:</strong> Strelkalar kursorni katakdan katakka siljitadi.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Live Playground -->
          <div class="playground-box">
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem;">
